  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;is a complex number satisfying <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> cannot be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0132_0af7213fd5fe.jpeg\" /><br />Using perpendicular distance of line from origin, minimum value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />Maximum value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> can&rsquo;t be <math><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
  }
